WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
We play black and move first. Score = our stones
plus the empty points only we surround.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:13.749 line:0
Our turn: click an empty intersection.
A placed stone cannot move or be taken back.

00:00:13.749 --> 00:00:17.001 line:0
White replies next to it.
Now watch the stones' liberties.

00:00:17.001 --> 00:00:27.000 line:0
Empty neighbouring points are liberties.
White E5 has three black neighbours and one liberty.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.500 line:0
Our turn: play D5, the last liberty.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.000 line:0
White E5 has no liberty left and is captured.
The capture count appears beside the seat.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:46.000 line:0
Fast-forward: both sides take territory and capture.
A move that leaves no liberties must capture.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:57.000 line:0
With nothing worth playing, press Pass and confirm.
Two passes in a row end play and start counting.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.500 line:0
The server fades stones it thinks are dead;
squares show the territory each side surrounds.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:09.000 line:0
Black J9 is surrounded but not marked.
Tap it: the whole group is marked dead.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:19.000 line:0
We press Confirm count and wait for the opponent.
When both confirm, the server scores the area.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:28.000 line:0
Black has 46 points; White has 35 plus 7.5 komi.
Black wins by 3.5 points.
